{"availability":"available","full":"adnan-bhaldar/Bindery","name":"Bindery","description":"A local-first PDF scanner and editor. Import, crop, OCR, and export — all in the browser, no uploads.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":1,"created":"2026-06-29T09:31:00Z","updated":"2026-10-02T05:45:01Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bindery.vercel.app","topics":["converter","img2pdf","modern-ui","opensource","webapp"],"demo":"https://bindery.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:14.858Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:14.858Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:14.858Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:07:14.858Z","stars":1,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Turn a pile of photos and screenshots into a clean, exportable PDF.","Local-first. Private. Built for the messy paperwork of everyday life.","[](#) [](#license) [](#tech-stack) [](#tech-stack)"],"features":["Drag-and-drop or browse to import — including PDFs, not just images. Every page of an imported PDF becomes a fully editable page, just like a photo: reorder by dragging, rotate, crop, duplicate, delete, or set a cover…","Every page can be tuned independently — Image Fit (Fit / Fill / Original / Stretch) and margin — or you can bulk-apply a setting across the whole project. Choose a page size (A4, Letter, A3, or Auto, sized exactly to…","Extract text in English, Hindi, or Marathi (or let it auto-detect), then select or copy it straight from the properties panel. Recognition happens in a Web Worker on your machine — nothing is sent anywhere.","Background autosave, session recovery if a tab closes unexpectedly, a history of recent projects with their own settings, and full undo/redo — including drag-reorders.","Installable as a desktop or mobile PWA and works offline. A command palette (⌘K) and keyboard shortcuts for everything. Light, dark, or system theme. Update notifications when a new version ships."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adnan-bhaldar/Bindery/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"579e3e7dfc354ce0afe17bc306b9e8aeb169f607adefc9b26784fd0a88959d77","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:14.994Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:14.994Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Turn a pile of photos and screenshots into a clean, exportable PDF.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adnan-bhaldar/Bindery/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Local-first. Private. Built for the messy paperwork of everyday life.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adnan-bhaldar/Bindery/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"Sign up or log in from the header to save your settings to your account and load them back on another device — entirely optional, and completely separate from your files.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adnan-bhaldar/Bindery/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"If you choose to sign up, the only things that ever reach a server are your login credentials and your app settings (theme, import/export defaults, and so on) — and only when you explicitly click save or load.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adnan-bhaldar/Bindery/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"579e3e7dfc354ce0afe17bc306b9e8aeb169f607adefc9b26784fd0a88959d77","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adnan-bhaldar/Bindery/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:14.994Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-02T05:45:01Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adnan-bhaldar/Bindery/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:14.997Z","hash":"579e3e7dfc354ce0afe17bc306b9e8aeb169f607adefc9b26784fd0a88959d77","originalBytes":7265,"storedBytes":7265,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["npm","run","only","page","settings","account","bindery","build","client","install","license","server","env","import","sync","bash","built","dev","enti